## Installation & Usage

### Option 1 — Just run the app (no coding needed)

1. Go to the [Releases] section of this repository
2. Download the `.zip` archive and unzip it into a folder of your choice
3. Create a desktop shortcut to `Обратный Процент.exe` inside that folder
4. Double-click the shortcut to run

   > Note: a console window may briefly appear alongside the app — this is a known cosmetic issue and doesn't affect functionality.

### Option 2 — Run from source (for developers)

**Requirements:** Python 3.x installed

\`\`\`bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/reverse-tax-calculator.git
cd reverse-tax-calculator
python emae.py
\`\`\`

No external dependencies required — the app only uses Python's built-in `tkinter` library.

### Building the .exe yourself

\`\`\`bash
pip install pyinstaller
pyinstaller --onefile --noconsole emae.py
\`\`\`

The executable will appear in the `dist/` folder.
